  "description": "The assault rifle held by the man is a symbol of militarism and aggression. In the context of the meme, it visually reinforces the threat posed by immigrants, suggesting that they are a danger that must be confronted or eliminated. This imagery is often used in political and extremist rhetoric to evoke fear and justify violence or authoritarian control.",
